          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ũu nĩw’o mũkeaan’ya nthĩ ĩno kwĩanana na mbaĩ sya Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kũkeethĩwa, mũkamĩaan’ya na nzĩa ya kũlimana yĩthĩwe ũtiĩwa kwenyu na kwa aeni ala mekalaa ũeni kwenyu, ala makasyaa syana me katĩ wenyu; na makeethĩwa kwenyu ta ala masyaĩwe kwenyu katĩ wa ana ma Isilaeli; makeethĩwa na ũtiĩwa vamwe nenyu katĩ wa mbaĩ sya Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.22"
            ]
          }
        },
